INSERT INTO `achievement` VALUES ('','Vicious Saddle (1)','',13452,-1,1,63103,15270,0,0,1180672,99,1379171,103533,78329,0,0,0,0,69497),('','Vicious Saddle (1)','',13453,-1,0,63099,15270,0,0,1180672,97,1379171,103533,78331,0,0,0,0,69497),('Learn five hyena facts from Gwybod in a single visit to Brackenhide Hollow on Mythic Difficulty.','Subscribed to Hyena Facts','',16110,2520,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,28,4066925,0,138863,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Chrono-Lord Deios after catching 20 Eternity Orbs as they fall to the ground in Uldaman: Legacy of Tyr on Mythic difficulty.','Like Sands Through the Hourglass','',16281,2451,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,51,525134,0,137473,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Sentinel Talondras after simultaneously stunning both Sentinel Talondras and all party members in Uldaman: Legacy of Tyr on Mythic difficulty.','No, You\'re Stunning!','',16282,2451,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,50,464160,0,137467,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Hackclaw\'s War-Band after freeing Chief Softpaw, equipping her with a spear and shield, and making sure she survives in Brackenhide Hollow on Mythic difficulty.','Growlbossify','',16296,2520,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,30,2059635,0,138443,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Kokia Blazehoof after heating up 4 life pools with Molten Boulder in Ruby Life Pools on Mythic difficulty.','Does Steam Do Fire Damage?','',16320,2521,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,40,4554434,0,137968,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Umbrelskul without being hit by a polymorph trap or triggering a Shriek in The Azure Vault on Mythic difficulty.','You Must Be Made of Hide','',16330,2515,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,42,132320,0,138059,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Umbrelskul after smashing Shimmering Geodes with Dragon Strike and destroying 9 Geode Chunks in The Azure Vault on Mythic difficulty.','The Cracked Crystal','',16331,2515,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,44,132781,0,138062,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Bromach while 10 or more Stonevault Troggs are still alive in Uldaman: Legacy of Tyr on Mythic difficulty.','It\'s a Trogg Eat Trogg World','',16337,2451,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,49,134024,0,138089,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Melidrussa after defeating 40 of her chamber\'s Infused Whelps in Ruby Life Pools on Mythic difficulty.','Dragon Kill Points','',16402,2521,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,39,4397694,0,138347,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Decatriarch Wratheye after finding and planting three Resilient Mushrooms, then destroying them with Decaystrike in Brackenhide Hollow on Mythic difficulty.','So You Can Kill This in a Way That Matters...','',16404,2520,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,32,134052,0,138865,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat the Gulping Goliath after forcing it to become Hangry and devour 10 Curious Swoglets in Halls of Infusion on Mythic difficulty.','Hungry Hungry Hornswog','',16426,2527,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,34,237553,0,138937,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat the Primal Tsunami after slaying three Flow Control Units in Halls of Infusion on Mythic difficulty.','Go With the Flow','',16427,2527,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,35,135861,0,138966,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Treemouth after every player has been consumed at least once in Brackenhide Hollow on Mythic difficulty.','All Bark, All Bite','',16430,2520,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,31,132103,0,138861,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Forgemaster Gorek without being struck by Forgestorm, Forgefire, Blazing Eruptions, another player\'s Blazing Aegis, or the final slam of Heated Swings in Neltharus on Mythic difficulty.','Ready for Raiding VIII','',16432,2519,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,37,136186,0,139357,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Chargath, Bane of Scales while burning less than 15 books in Neltharus on Mythic difficulty.','Knowledge is... Preserved?','',16438,2519,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,36,4549131,0,138535,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Kyrakka and Erkhart Stormvein after chilling, searing, tempering, and keeping alive the Nascent Ruby Egg in Ruby Life Pools on Mythic difficulty.','Are You My Broodmother?','',16440,2521,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,41,4509422,0,138600,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Crawth after simultaneously activating both Goals in Algeth\'ar Academy on Mythic difficulty.','Squad Goals','',16441,2526,-1,0,15277,0,0,2048,107,464077,0,138568,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Telash Greywing after using Icy Devastator 12 times on an Icy Crystal to create a Very Icy Crystal in The Azure Vault on Mythic difficulty.','Icy What You Did There','',16445,2515,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,43,2060147,0,138544,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat the Raging Tempest after striking a single player with 5 Lightning Strikes simultaneously and defeating a Storm Elemental in The Nokhud Offensive on Mythic difficulty.','What Are The Chances...','',16447,2516,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,45,4554460,0,138570,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Magmatusk after it has been mutated with Draconic Tincture in Neltharus on Mythic difficulty.','Liquid Hot Magma','',16453,2519,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,38,959797,0,140744,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Teera and Maruuk while holding the Spear of Tolui, War Axe of Berke, and Bow of Sartaq in The Nokhud Offensive on Mythic difficulty.','Weapons of the Maruukai','',16456,2516,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,46,615102,0,138925,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat the Toxic Swogmother after Purging the Water Intakes in Halls of Infusion on Mythic difficulty.','Toxicity Strike Team','',16517,2527,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,33,132104,0,138927,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Balakar Khan after healing Ohn\'ahra to full health in The Nokhud Offensive on Mythic difficulty.','Nokhud Deed Goes Unnoticed','',16602,2516,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,47,4080564,0,139461,0,0,0,0,69497),('Deliver eight warm ohuna eggs to Ohuna Keeper Taruk in a single visit to The Nokhud Offensive on Mythic difficulty.','Ohuna Incubation','',16620,2516,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,48,236999,0,139483,0,0,0,0,69497),('Free every Captive Tuskarr in a Meat Storage in a single visit to Brackenhide Hollow.','The Vegetarian Diet','Toy: Happy Tuskarr Palooza',16762,2520,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,29,4635249,200631,140932,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Tyr, the Infinite Keeper after closing 18 Time Rifts in Dawn of the Infinite on Mythic difficulty.','Back En-masse','',18539,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,57,4622479,0,147085,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Manifested Timeways after activating 3 Chaotic Time portals in Dawn of the Infinite on Mythic difficulty.','Chaotic Time','',18556,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,55,237538,0,147166,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Chronikar after she shatters an Infused Hourglass with Eon Shatter in Dawn of the Infinite on Mythic difficulty.','Crunch Time','',18589,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,54,1391676,0,147406,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Blight of Galakrond after allowing a lost slime to hop on your back and then getting hit by Blight Reclamation in Dawn of the Infinite on Mythic difficulty.','A Slime in Need','',18612,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,56,1500940,0,147475,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Iridikron in Dawn of the Infinite.','Dawn of the Infinite: Galakrond\'s Fall','',18703,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,52,5247561,0,147817,0,0,0,0,69497),('Defeat Chrono-Lord Deios in Dawn of the Infinite.','Dawn of the Infinite: Murozond\'s Rise','',18704,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,53,5247561,0,147819,0,0,0,0,69497),('Within a single run, defeat all bosses in Dawn of the Infinite and restore the four time-lost artifacts without any player dying on Mythic difficulty.','Put That Thing Back Where It Came From','Appearance: Infinite Acolyte\'s Regalia',18706,2579,-1,0,15467,0,10,0,58,4630469,0,147835,0,0,0,0,69497),('Outgrow the use of Champion Dawncrests during Midnight Season 1.','Champion of the Dawn','Character Unlock: Trade Champion for Hero Dawncrests',42768,-1,-1,42767,81,0,0,2048,227,7639520,0,212354,0,0,0,0,69497),('End Midnight Season 1 in the top 0.1% of the Rated Battleground Blitz ladder (requires 50 games won in Midnight Season 1).','Galactic Warlord: Midnight Season 1','Character Title: Galactic Warlord',61178,-1,0,0,15270,0,0,14336,312,236540,0,0,0,0,0,0,69497),('Win 100 Solo Shuffle rounds as a Healer at or above Rival I during Midnight.','Solo Shuffle Medic: Midnight','Reward: Nightfall Legend\'s Pennant',61199,-1,-1,0,15270,0,0,145408,10,135915,0,216244,0,0,0,0,69497),('Win 50 Battleground Blitz mat